otengine/godot/pulls/115532","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115532","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115532.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115532.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-16T16:24:54Z"},"body":"Fixes #115477.\r\n\r\nAs seen in #115477, there are times when `RemoteDebugger` ends up having `RemoteDebugger::poll_events` called during the message polling loop in `RemoteDebugger::debug`, which leads to messages from the editor being improperly flushed and effectively discarded, causing a number of issues on macOS in particular.\r\n\r\nThis seemingly fixes that by having `RemoteDebugger::poll_events` early-out if we're already in `RemoteDebugger::debug`.\r\n\r\n(I also threw in some minor refactoring/cleanup.)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115532/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115532/timeline",